      "name": "Botão primário",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "Ação principal da tela, como Traçar rota.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-pri\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6 20a2 2 0 100-4 2 2 0 000 4zM18 8a2 2 0 100-4 2 2 0 000 4zM6 16V10a3 3 0 013-3h3M18 8v6a3 3 0 01-3 3h-3\"/></svg>Traçar rota</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-pri{font-family:Archivo,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:15.5px;font-weight:750;min-height:50px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #cc3366;background:#cc3366;color:#fff;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .15s,transform .12s}.ds-btn-pri svg{width:18px;height:18px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.9;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.ds-btn-pri:hover{filter:brightness(1.06)}.ds-btn-pri:active{transform:scale(.98)}.ds-btn-pri:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #cc3366;outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Botão secundário",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-secondary",
